Pillow (the Python Imaging Library fork)

src/resample.rs is a port of the 8-bit Lanczos resampling code in Pillow's
libImaging/Resample.c (coefficient precomputation, 22-bit fixed-point
normalisation, horizontal-then-vertical passes and clipping), so that this
service resizes exactly as Pillow does.

