isnet-general-use (the model this project is verified against)

The default model is the "IS-Net" from "Highly Accurate Dichotomous Image
Segmentation" (Xuebin Qin, Hang Dai, Xiaobin Hu, Deng-Ping Fan, Ling Shao,
Luc Van Gool; ECCV 2022), https://github.com/xuebinqin/DIS, as exported and
redistributed by the rembg project (Daniel Gatis),
https://github.com/danielgatis/rembg, whose DisSession pre- and
post-processing this project reproduces. The weights are not included in
this repository or its container image; see the README for how to obtain
them and check their hash.

